This project is a modified (fork) version of Elodie by jmathai
(https://github.com/jmathai/elodie), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

Modifications to the original work include, but are not limited to:

  * A graphical user interface (GUI) under the gui/ directory.
  * Chinese localization files (zh_cn.pm and related data).
  * Home-based three-tier location folder paths ([Home] config section
    with full_path / home_country / home_province templates).
  * A "set home" feature that auto-detects home country/state from a
    photo's GPS metadata.
  * Enhanced duplicate scanning (statistics, cancel, scan-all, and
    open-containing-folder options).

